// The schedule matching WoSX's parallel solve: fcpw4w16.bonsai with the
// points spread over the CPU threads -- WalkOnSpheres::solve's
// tbb::parallel_for over the sample points, each point's walks on the
// thread that took it -- which here is the parfor of solve_all bound to the
// threads and handed, by the compiled code, to runtime/bonsai_parallel.h's
// tbb::parallel_for over the same TBB. Everything else is the single-thread
// schedule's, imported. compare.sh runs this one with the driver's
// --threads, pinned to the performance cores.
import apps/wosx/schedules/fcpw4w16;

schedule {
    solve_all.bind(i, CPUThread);
}
